''Not to be confused with {{i|Cain's Other Eye}}.''

{{cit|ut}}

== Effects ==
* When starting a floor, 25% chance to gain the effect of {{i|The Compass}} for the duration of the floor.
** {{dlc|a+}} The chance increases based on the [[Luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>\frac1 { 4 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck}  \right \rfloor}</math>
*** At base luck (0), the chance is 25%, maxing out at 100% at 3 luck.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Book of Secrets|r}}: Can make it easier to gain {{i|X-Ray Vision}} as Book of Secrets cannot give a mapping effect Isaac already has.
* {{I|Glowing Hourglass|r}}: Traveling back to the previous floor and going back down may trigger the Cain's Eye if it hasn’t triggered before.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either doubles the chance to trigger The Compass effect. Having both triples the chance.

